  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add net10 support. Fixed cache key generation: now uses request headers instead of response headers. By default only Authorization, Accept and Accept-Language are part of the cache key, avoiding mixing cached responses between users or content negotiation. Add new option IncludedHeaders to add more request headers to the cache key. ExcludedHeaders now removes headers from the included headers. Fixed false 'Response has already started' log on every cache hit. Improved logging performance using structured logging.",
